cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this calculator, please cite it as below."
title: "90-day mortality risk score for in-hospital ischemic stroke: online calculator"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, offline-capable web calculator implementing a points-based
  score for 90-day mortality risk after in-hospital ischemic stroke, based on
  a Cox proportional hazards model (5 predictors, LASSO selection). Research
  and education tool; not a medical device.
authors:
